327 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (When Vineyard began its transformation from the industrial Geneva Steel site into one of the fastest-growing communities in Utah, city leadership knew they would need new tools to make it possible. One of the tools used is a Redevelopment Agency \(RDA\), which uses Tax Increment Financing to fund long-term infrastructure necessary for growth. This growth shifts the tax burden off the residents while creating jobs, homes, schools, and spaces for communities to raise families. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
