/E (Through the years, Vineyard has grown tremendously, and the population continues to increase, creating the need for a chief Deputy position in the city. Lieutenant Holden Rockwell has been promoted to that position.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
467 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Chief Deputy Rockwell has managed the Vineyard office since 2017. He works closely with Vineyard City to provide the best service possible for you. He enjoys serving the citizens of Vineyard and appreciates the sense of community. Chief Deputy Rockwell has worked for Utah County for the past 14 years. Prior to that, he worked for the South Jordan Police Department. In his free time, he likes camping, hunting and spending time with his family. He loves a good steak and a cold Pepsi.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
